     "href": "/cn/zh/ikea-business/gallery/a-graceful-cafe-with-a-fresh-inviting-charm-pub641a8e49",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "都市氛围的波奇饭餐厅",
     "text": "桦木餐桌和座椅、竹编灯具和日光下的水磨石，为这间明亮得几乎有些耀眼的酒吧餐厅设定了基调。可在这里探索其中的奥秘。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/e6/0e/e60e2fd5f7808496734c17cd719afdf2.jpg",
     "href": "/cn/zh/ikea-business/gallery/poke-bowl-perfection-with-an-airy-metropolitan-mood-pubadb43084",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "氛围活跃的融合风格酒吧和咖啡厅",
     "text": "查看我们如何装修经典意式咖啡吧，赋予其独特风貌，使其获得稳定的客流，成为一个功能出众且氛围迷人的欢聚场所。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/4f/07/4f07cf2bedbf8a225385e6a35d9b4e7a.jpg",
     "href": "/cn/zh/ikea-business/gallery/a-well-planned-coffee-bar-with-a-colourful-timeless-expression-pub86c828a3",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "满足不同需求的全天候餐吧",
     "text": "想把你的餐吧打造成令人流连忘返的好地方？一起来看看这些布置创意，打造一个带分区的餐吧，满足顾客用餐、品尝小吃和小饮一杯的需求。立即在线选购。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/2b/7a/2b7acf09128e367373f67d7b2ce70a59.jpg",
     "href": "/cn/zh/ikea-business/gallery/man-zu-bu-tong-xu-qiu-de-quan-tian-hou-can-ba-pub38d8e040",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "人人都喜欢的社区咖啡厅",
     "text": "想为带露天座位的咖啡厅寻找家具布置创意？一起来看看这个有丰富座位的社区咖啡厅。立即在线浏览并选购。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/f2/28/f228a8a2ba4b57c3565b6d17f1eb9cc0.jpg",
     "href": "/cn/zh/ikea-business/gallery/yong-you-ling-huo-kong-jian-de-she-qu-ga-fei-ting-bu-zhi-chuang-yi-pub9cad5540",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "休闲享受美食",
     "text": "你在从事餐饮业务吗？一起来看看这些布置创意，了解如何让餐厅充满活力，并能从热闹午餐到约会晚餐，轻松切换氛围。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250826/ca54263897a64daa9ec8d75c3b6351b3.png?x-oss-process=style/medium",
     "href": "/cn/zh/ikea-business/gallery/xiu1-xian2-xiang3-shou4-mei3-shi2-pub5f1e55d0",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "如家般温馨的餐厅",
     "text": "在为你的餐厅寻找室内设计灵感吗？这家乡村木屋风格的餐厅提供耐用舒适的家具，不妨从中获取灵感。立即选购。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/a5/99/a599e17dacba86c5207e3a7e9646dd71.jpg",
     "href": "/cn/zh/ikea-business/gallery/ru2-jia1-ban1-wen1-xin1-de-can1-ting1-pubc0ee97c6",
     "backgroundColor": null
    }
